# Built plugin payloads. A build-capable plugin compiles into its own directory; a
# built-in ships source, not a binary.
*.exe
*.dll
*.sys
*.o
*.a
*.lib
# The VERSIONINFO values, written next to the shared template by the build. `clean` removes
# them, but a build that fails at the compile step never reaches it.
verinfo.h
verinfo-*.h
